# Code-signing material (docs/code-signing.md). The public .cer is safe to share; keys and Base64 secrets are not.
VoxShift-signing/
WINDOWS_CODESIGN_*.txt
*_BASE64.txt
appsettings.*.local.json

# Python tooling cache (docs/tools)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OS files
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Archives
*.zip
